      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. The Finance Administration, after consulting with the administration, department, or agency involved, shall specify, consistently with designations of deposit banks made by the Banking Commission, the banks in which every account representing funds handled by such administration, department, or agency for City use is placed.",
